# __SITE_TITLE__

Generated by Portfolio Builder. This is a real, standalone Vite + React
project — your portfolio content lives in `src/data.json` and the template
component lives in `src/templates/__TEMPLATE_ID__/`.

## Run it locally

```sh
bun install   # or npm install / pnpm install
bun dev       # or npm run dev
```

## Build for production

```sh
bun run build
```

Output goes to `dist/`. Deploy `dist/` anywhere that serves static files.

## Editing your content

Edit `src/data.json` directly, or make your changes in Portfolio Builder and
re-download. The shape of this file matches the `PortfolioData` schema from
[`@pb/templates`](https://github.com/__ORG__/portfolio-builder-templates).
